                                "sense_id": "718583fb-717e-3772-9fbe-daa1efbf6125",
                                "text": "At length we saw a four-wheeler drive up. Out of it, in leisurely fashion, got Lord Godalming and Morris. And down from the box descended a thick-set working man with his rush-woven basket of tools. Morris paid the cabman, who touched his hat and drove away."
